Modes:
  LEARN    — learn framework fundamentals
  APPLY    — apply framework to current task
  REVIEW   — review framework skills
  UPGRADE  — propose framework skill upgrade

Rules:
  [F1]  Skills MUST be organized by framework.
  [F2]  Each framework MUST have L1-L4 layers.
  [F3]  Framework skills MUST reference language skills.
  [F4]  Skills MUST be loaded on demand.
  [F5]  Framework skills MUST NOT contain project-specific content.

